  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 6'5ft bed of the 2015-2026 Ford F150. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Ford F150 styleside 6.5ft bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPrecisely Fit: Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 6'7\" bed of 2015-2026 Ford F150.\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with adjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user friendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nWHY Quad Fold: More access room when folded up, more durable with one more cross bar and two more firm clamps than trifold cover.\nSafety First: Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the bed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high temperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is like, we’ve got you covered.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.",
